{"product_id":"pixel-smartwatch","title":"Pixel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003ePixel Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet the Pixel Smartwatch, the ultimate fusion of technology and style, designed to simplify and enhance your everyday life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for those who demand both functionality and elegance in their wearable tech, the Pixel Smartwatch offers a seamless user experience with its intuitive features and sophisticated design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pixel Smartwatch is packed with features to help you stay on top of your health and connected to what matters most.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMonitor your fitness with advanced tracking capabilities, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes. Stay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all accessible from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and apps right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts vibrant, high-resolution display ensures everything is crystal clear, while the long-lasting battery keeps you powered through your day. With customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can personalize your Pixel Smartwatch to match any outfit or occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Pixel Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Pixel SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Pixel Smartwatch means opting for a device that seamlessly integrates into your life. Its comprehensive features, high-quality build, and stylish design make it a standout choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're tracking your fitness, staying connected, or simply enhancing your style, the Pixel Smartwatch delivers. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rainbow Gold","offer_id":48544548913430,"sku":"20449","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48543732826390,"sku":"20153","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48543732760854,"sku":"20154","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48543732728086,"sku":"20152","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3_1_-1.png?v=1717406207","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/pixel-smartwatch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}